{"type":"reasoning","timestamp":1788506667596,"sessionID":"ses_f94b3b3fdffeGjmu6JJ70nAmp6","part":{"id":"prt_06b4df50e001CNjAhE1O0qh1gb","messageID":"msg_06b4de95a001T1HspzwFX9ueiE","sessionID":"ses_f94b3b3fdffeGjmu6JJ70nAmp6","type":"reasoning","text":"The feature is from PR #886 by @luhn, in PyJWT 2.9.0:\n- Allow `jwt.decode()` to accept a PyJWK object by @luhn in #886\n- Make `algorithm_name` attribute available on PyJWK by @luhn in #886\n\nLet me fetch PR #886 diff to get the exact implementation.","time":{"start":1788506666254,"end":1788506667576},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"The feature is from PR #886 by @luhn, in PyJWT 2.9.0:\n- Allow `jwt.decode()` to accept a PyJWK object by @luhn in #886\n- Make `algorithm_name` attribute available on PyJWK by @luhn in #886\n\nLet me fetch PR #886 diff to get the exact implementation.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}}}}
